  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">VB MDTF N&#xf6;dhj&#xe4;lp och resilience f&#xf6;r Moldavien 2022 - 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB MDTF Moldova Emergency Response and Resilience 2022 - 2024 - WB MDTF Moldova Emergency Response and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida fick i uppdrag i regleringsbrevet den 1 december 2022 att kanalisera 40 MSEK till V&#xe4;rldbankens fond f&#xf6;r Moldavien MDTF Emergency Response. Fonden som utg&#xf6;r budgetst&#xf6;d till den moldaviska regeringen l&#xf6;per till och med november 2022 och syftar till att hj&#xe4;lpa flyktingarna fr&#xe5;n Ukraina och i minska den negativa p&#xe5;verkan fr&#xe5;n kriget i Ukraina p&#xe5; Moldavien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida recieved the assignment in the letter of appropriation dated 1 Dec 2022 to channel 40 MSEK to the World Bank fund for Moldova MDTF Emergency Response. The fund constitutes budget support to the Moldovan government and runs up to and including November 2022. The aim of the fund is to support Ukrainian refugees in Moldova and alleviate the consequences of the war in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the contribution is to support the Moldovan government, through budget support to;

1) mitigate the impact of the war in Ukraine on refugees and households; and 

2) build resilience and enhance  competitiveness to reduce vulnerability to future shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
